 awareness, vehicle turbochargers, weather radars, and wheels and braking systems. It also provides aerospace trading, asset availability, cabin connectivity, maintenance and service plans, certifications, training, and other flight services; and GoDirect Trade, an e-commerce platform that offers access to new and used air transport and business aircraft parts. The company's platform includes business jets, airlines/cargo planes, helicopters, defense, space, general aviation, and automotive platforms. It provides products and services to military fixed and rotary wing operators in South America, Latin America, Africa, and the Middle East. The company was founded in 1914 and is based in Phoenix, Arizona. Honeywell Aerospace Inc. is as a prior subsidiary of Honeywell International Inc.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"3724","sic_desc":"Aircraft Engines & Engine Parts","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","mcap":49010401280,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","hq":"PHOENIX, AZ","exchange":"XNAS","fy_end":"1231","cik":2089271,"state_inc":"DE","massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)","sec_asof":"2026-10-03"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"Yahoo quarterly income statement via yfinance (third-party fallback)","asof":"2026-10-03","q":[{"end":"2025-03-31","rev":4074000000.0,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":2.452652,"eps_yoy":null,"ni":777000000.0,"ni_yoy":null,"nm":19.1,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2025-06-30","rev":4289000000.0,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":2.664141,"eps_yoy":null,"ni":844000000.0,"ni_yoy":null,"nm":19.7,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2026-03-31","rev":4352000000.0,"rev_yoy":6.8,"eps":1.59,"eps_yoy":-35.2,"ni":504000000.0,"ni_yoy":-35.1,"nm":11.6,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2026-06-30","rev":4522000000.0,"rev_yoy":5.4,"eps":0.78,"eps_yoy":-70.7,"ni":246000000.0,"ni_yoy":-70.9,"nm":5.4,"derived":null,"fp":null}],"a":[{"end":"20